        "q1": "<div style='background-color: #f1f2f6; border-left: 5px solid #6c5ce7; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;'><strong style='display: block; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 5px;'>Part 1: Questions 1-10</strong><span style='font-size: 0.9rem; color: #57606f;'>Complete the form below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</span></div><div style='background: #fdfefe; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 25px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 25px; line-height: 1.8;'><h2 style='margin-top: 0; color: #6c5ce7; border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f2f6; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;'>OZ HOUSESITTERS - HOME OWNER REGISTRATION FORM</h2><ul style='list-style-type: none; padding-left: 5px;'><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• Name: Jenny Hall</li><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• Address: 14 <span class='question-badge'>1</span> <input type='text' id='ans-1' style='width: 180px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'> St Greenfield</li><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• Mobile no.: <span class='question-badge'>2</span> <input type='text' id='ans-2' style='width: 180px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></li><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• Date required from: <span class='question-badge'>3</span> <input type='text' id='ans-3' style='width: 200px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></li><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• Length of time required: <span class='question-badge'>4</span> <input type='text' id='ans-4' style='width: 80px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; text-align: center; outline: none;'> weeks</li></ul><h3 style='color: #2f3542; margin-top: 25px; border-left: 4px solid #6c5ce7; padding-left: 10px;'>House features:</h3><ul style='list-style-type: none; padding-left: 5px;'><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• it has a new <span class='question-badge'>5