rder-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 25px; line-height: 1.8;'><div style='background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #e1e8ed; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; font-weight: 500;'><div><strong>A</strong> family support</div><div><strong>B</strong> getting a loan from a bank</div><div><strong>C</strong> good business advice</div><div><strong>D</strong> a favourable economic climate</div><div><strong>E</strong> an effective approach to business</div></div><div style='display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;'><span>Lựa chọn thứ nhất: <span class='question-badge'>19</span> <input type='text' id='ans-19' style='width: 60px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></span><span>Lựa chọn thứ hai: <span class='question-badge'>20</span> <input type='text' id='ans-20' style='width: 60px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></span></div></div>",
