rder: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></div><div>• 23. Bouncing balls: <span class='question-badge'>23</span> <input type='text' id='ans-23' style='width: 60px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></div><div>• 24. Making paper: <span class='question-badge'>24</span> <input type='text' id='ans-24' style='width: 60px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></div><div>• 25. Tie-dyeing: <span class='question-badge'>25</span> <input type='text' id='ans-25' style='width: 60px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></div><div>• 26. Glue from milk: <span class='question-badge'>26</span> <input type='text' id='ans-26' style='width: 60px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></div></div></div><div style='background-color: #f1f2f6; border-left: 5px solid #fab1a0; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;'><strong style='display: block; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 5px;'>Questions 27-30</strong><span style='font-size: 0.9rem; color: #57606f;'>Label the diagram below. Write the correct letter, <strong>A–G</strong>, next to questions 27-30.</span></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; line-height: 1.8;'><h4 style='margin-top: 0; text-align: center; color: #2f3542; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: bold;'>Condenser Apparatus</h4><div style='text-align: center; margin: 15px 0;'><img src='audio/vol_4/2/diagram.png' alt='Condenser apparatus diagram' onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" style='max-width: 100%; max-height: 400px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radi