tyle='width: 180px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'> a work area</li></ul><h3 style='color: #2f3542; margin-top: 20px; border-left: 4px solid #e84393; padding-left: 10px;'>Survey results</h3><p style='font-weight: 600; color: #57606f; margin-left: 5px;'>Attitudes of employees to open-plan designs:</p><ul style='list-style-type: none; padding-left: 5px;'><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• there is a lack of <span class='question-badge'>35</span> <input type='text' id='ans-35' style='width: 180px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'> and <span class='question-badge'>36</span> <input type='text' id='ans-36' style='width: 180px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'></li><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• they pose a risk to our <span class='question-badge'>37</span> <input type='text' id='ans-37' style='width: 180px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'> (staff records support this)</li></ul><p style='font-weight: 600; color: #57606f; margin-left: 5px; margin-top: 15px;'>Attitudes of employers to open-plan designs:</p><ul style='list-style-type: none; padding-left: 5px;'><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• they significantly reduce rent and <span class='question-badge'>38</span> <input type='text' id='ans-38' style='width: 180px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'> costs</li><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• they improve teamwork and communication</li><li style='margin-bottom: 12px;'>• they can make <span class='question-badge'>39</span> <input type='text' id='ans-39' style='width: 180px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #ced6e0; border-radius: 6px; outline: none;'> staff easier</li></ul><p style='margin-top: 20px; font-weight: 500;'>In reality, employees are unhappy and they are often distracted by the <span class='question-badge'>40</span> <input type='text' id='an